[{"title":"漾备道中","author":"童轩","text":"十载驰驱不暂休，乂衔君命到南陬。\n凉蝉细雨疏槐晚，疲马西风落叶秋。\n万里有家恒作客，一官多累谩成忧。\n平生事业知何在，孤负沧浪旧钓舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿新田驿","author":"童轩","text":"废驿年深草亦深，败垣颓壁倚危岑。\n床头尘满伊威集，帘外风凄络纬吟。\n孤枕不堪乡梦断，弊衾殊觉早寒侵。\n独怜几树梅花月，识我平生一片心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登五华寺戒上人楼","author":"童轩","text":"乘闲时倚远公楼，一段风烟豁醉眸。\n山色遥连梁岳晚，潮声初涌海门秋。\n酒旗城郭西风急，禾黍人家夕照收。\n莫怪吟馀重回首，五云东北是神州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43937,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶书","author":"童轩","text":"万事无成两鬓皤，可堪岁月易蹉跎。\n宦途每感秋蓬客，世态偏惊春梦婆。\n上国故人青眼少，东山高兴白云多。\n何如束取琴书去，茅屋衡门掩翠萝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43938,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"童轩","text":"一种精神分外奇，肯同桃杏炫秾姿。\n春香小店年年酒，月冷閒庭夜夜诗。\n一枕暖云莺唤晓，满帘晴雪燕来时。\n洗妆最惜春风面，粉褪香残欲怨谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43939,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滇城早秋有怀沈启南","author":"童轩","text":"远塞风烟接海陬，萧条踪迹此淹留。\n西风黄叶填沙岸，落日青山绕郡楼。\n孤馆不眠惟听雨，异乡多病厌逢秋。\n何因共醉吴门酒，一洗胸中万斛愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腐儒","author":"童轩","text":"老大乾坤一腐儒，支颐长日叹归与。\n功名误我难忘国，风雨怀人数寄书。\n兴入莼鲈秋水远，梦迷蕉鹿夜灯馀。\n何当解组居林下，曲径穿花驾小车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪谷卷为戒上人题","author":"童轩","text":"一夜东风大放颠，晓来深谷雪盈椽。\n谁知定里还生白，自信光中不拟禅。\n三径冻云留鹤迹，半檐寒气压茶烟。\n闭门不管青山老，布衲蒲团了十玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"建业清明书事","author":"童轩","text":"节物催人到客边，江南风景迥堪怜。\n鱼儿池馆新生水，燕子人家又禁烟。\n几片落花寒食后，数株高柳夕阳前。\n春衫小试香罗雪，骏马骄嘶白玉鞭。\n绿水青山浑似画，暖云芳草最宜眠。\n松醪有客邀村舍，麦饭谁家洒墓田。\n自愧道傍扬子宅，十年闭户虱生毡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为刘世亨侍御题夏仲昭墨竹","author":"童轩","text":"画中看竹忆江湘，秋叶萧萧水气凉。\n风细残绷和粉落，雨馀新绿过人长。\n高标似露螭头笔，直干偏含柱下霜。\n傲雪襟期浑雅淡，拂云头角正昂藏。\n琅玕潇洒同淇澳，红紫妖秾陋洛阳。\n摵摵清声常在耳，亭亭疏影半依墙。\n虚心自许能医俗，秀骨谁云似少香。\n别去几回劳梦想，兴来随处搅吟肠。\n使君高节传乌府，仙吏清风满太常。\n砚沼忽闻风雨作，袜材随见凤鸾翔。\n明窗日日宜相对，清兴时时自不忘。\n此外嚣尘浑绝迹，唯馀明月到中堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日卧病柬高仲显一首","author":"童轩","text":"红桃始破颜，绿杨已堪把。\n想应城南道，日日多车马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚寅中秋对月","author":"童轩","text":"去岁中秋夕，维舟楚水滨。\n可怜今夜月，犹照异乡人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"回至馀干望家","author":"童轩","text":"极目天涯路，孤帆千里归。\n倚门人不见，唯见白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都昌阻雪","author":"童轩","text":"积雪连旬晦，江空岁晏时。\n客途偏感慨，忍诵蓼莪诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖口夜泊","author":"童轩","text":"江水汇为泽，瀰漫深万丈。\n山寺晚钟鸣，湖心明月上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭蠡湖","author":"童轩","text":"万顷雪花卷，舟飞一叶轻。\n掀篷发清啸，疑恐小龙惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小孤山","author":"童轩","text":"秀色真可餐，云鬟不须理。\n江水湿罗衣，夫容满身紫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次望江见白鸥鸟","author":"童轩","text":"苍茫云水阔，飞去复飞还。\n十载红尘里，何因似尔闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊荻港","author":"童轩","text":"渔艇已收纶，斜阳下烟水。\n寂寂掩篷窗，坐听舟人语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石怀李白二首 其一","author":"童轩","text":"扁舟依采石，怅望谪仙人。\n我独船头坐，江流月色春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石怀李白二首 其二","author":"童轩","text":"扁舟依采石，牛渚浩风波。\n不见锦袍客，满篷凉月多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮入永平","author":"童轩","text":"青山围古邑，流水带荒村。\n马首愁云合，山头日欲昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倚楼","author":"童轩","text":"愁倚溪楼望，还因见月明。\n月明如有约，偏照别离情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴一首","author":"童轩","text":"细草春来绿，闲花雨后红。\n思君不能见，惆怅画楼东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192