"dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹阳晚眺","author":"童轩","text":"春水绿迢迢，空江自落潮。\n桥头两竿日，烟外酒旗飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43965,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中秋夕","author":"童轩","text":"远客难为别，西风吹月明。\n不堪残梦破，沙际乱虫鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43966,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"路经乌撒值清明日","author":"童轩","text":"边地清明日，凄凉叹未归。\n杨花知客意，撩乱马头飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43967,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漾备早行","author":"童轩","text":"流水黠曲响，乱山重叠横。\n行行天欲曙，立马看云生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43968,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"去寿昌作","author":"童轩","text":"来时此行李，去时此行李。\n俸外无一金，不愧桐江水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首 其一 牡丹群鸟","author":"童轩","text":"微雨朝来歇，红芳缀满枝。\n多情花里鸟，应爱日迟迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首 其二 荷花鹡鸰","author":"童轩","text":"斜日回塘静，红莲花半开。\n双双鹡鸰鸟，窥影去还来。","collection":"明","notice":"","pr